<title>USA: Dell Computer names vice president of finance.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer names vice president of finance.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp said on Thursday James Schneider has joined the company as vice president of finance, a newly created post.</p>
<p>Schneider comes to Dell from MCI Communications Corp, where he was senior vice president of finance for the $15 billion telecommunications company.</p>
<p>In his new position, Schneider reports to Tom Meredith, senior vice president and chief financial officer, Dell said.</p>
